<view class="page-cd-apply">
  <view class="container">
    <view class="card">
      <view class="section-title">病案所属住院人</view>

      <view wx:if="{{!loading && inpatients.length === 0}}" class="cda-empty">
        <view class="empty-icon">🏥</view>
        <view class="empty-title">还没有绑定住院人</view>
        <view class="text-muted empty-desc">申请病案邮寄需要先绑定住院号</view>
        <button class="btn-outline cda-empty-btn" bindtap="onBindInpatient">去绑定住院号</button>
      </view>

      <view
        wx:for="{{inpatients}}"
        wx:key="id"
        class="cda-inpatient {{selectedInpatientId === item.id ? 'cda-inpatient-on' : ''}}"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
        bindtap="onPickInpatient"
      >
        <view class="cda-inpatient-main">
          <text class="cda-inpatient-name">{{item.name}}</text>
          <text class="text-muted cda-inpatient-no">住院号 {{item.inpatientNo || '—'}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="text-muted cda-inpatient-ward">{{item.department}} · {{item.bedNo}}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{selectedInpatientId === item.id}}" class="cda-inpatient-check">✓</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="section-title">邮寄信息</view>
      <view class="cda-field">
        <text class="cda-label">收件人</text>
        <input
          class="cda-input"
          placeholder="请输入收件人姓名"
          value="{{recipientName}}"
          bindinput="onRecipientInput"
        />
      </view>
      <view class="cda-field cda-field-last">
        <text class="cda-label">收件地址</text>
        <textarea
          class="cda-textarea"
          placeholder="请输入详细收件地址"
          value="{{address}}"
          bindinput="onAddressInput"
        />
      </view>
      <view class="text-muted cda-tip">
        本版本不上传证件照片，也不收取配送费；申请提交后由医院后台处理
      </view>
    </view>

    <button
      class="btn-primary cda-submit"
      loading="{{submitting}}"
      disabled="{{submitting}}"
      bindtap="onSubmit"
    >提交申请</button>
  </view>
</view>
